The public or external IP is the IP that identifies us with the outside of our network. How the rest of the people would see our router.
Thus, it is the case that each device on a network has a different private IP but the same public IP that is assigned to the router. How to see the public ip
You should not facilitate it just because. For example, the ips that you see in the images of the article are not mine, I have changed it using TOR so that nobody knows my IP.
Or enter one of these addresses.
