Rana: If you want a thin dough and also in a round shape, this is yours. Although it must be said that it swells up quite a bit once in the oven.
Savory recipes with puff pastry: For those family snacks, nothing like some healthy salty recipes with puff pastry. You can do a kind of Patty, with two sheets of puff pastry and a filling that can range from minced meat to tuna.
Sweet recipes with puff pastry: Sweets are also the best complement to our menu. If you do not have anything prepared and guests arrive, we propose this puff pastry with jam and a soft touch of chocolate.
