To solve the problem of water accumulation in the eyewash, it is necessary to use antifreeze type eyewash, electric heat tracing eyewash or electric heating eyewash.
The electric heat tracing eyewash is heated by the electric tracing heat, so that the water in the eyewash does not freeze, and the temperature of the eyewash can be increased to a limited extent, but the temperature of the spray water cannot be increased at all. (Remarks: The flow of eyewash is 12-18 liters / min; the spray is 120-180 liters / min)
For those who do not have a fixed water source in the workplace, or need to change the workplace frequently, they can use a portable eyewash. This type of eyewash can be moved to the desired location on the job site, but this type of small portable eyewash has only eyewashing function, but no spray function.
