This article only discusses the installation of our company’s ABS eyewash, and explains how to install it correctly. This eyewash is an ABS composite eyewash BD-510, all of which are connected by pipe thread.
This connection method can not wrap raw material tape or use sealant at the pipe thread connection. It only needs to put the sealing rubber ring in the internal thread port, the rubber ring plane can be upwards, and then connect with the external thread until the rubber Press the ring tightly.
In actual operation, when the BD-510 ABS composite eyewash is installed, the connection of the two main pipes below the main body does not need to put a rubber ring, just tighten the thread connection. Because this section is a flush basin wastewater drainage pipe, there is no water pressure, and there is no water when not in use.
Water test, if there is water leakage at the connection, it is necessary to tighten the rubber ring at the connection. If the leakage is serious, consider whether the apron is placed or the placement surface is wrong, and the plane of the apron should be upward.
