When the globe valve is fully open, the handwheel should be reversed a little, so that the threads are tight, so as to avoid loosening and damage.
When the pipeline is used for the first time, there are many internal dirt, so the cut-off valve can be opened slightly, washed away by the high-speed flow of the medium, and then closed gently (not closed quickly or violently, so as to prevent the residual impurities from hurting the sealing surface), opened again, repeated many times, washed clean dirt, and then put into normal work.
Normally open the globe valve, there may be dirt on the sealing surface. When it is closed, the above method should also be used to wash it clean, and then officially close.
